---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../consts';

// Where Buttondown sends a reader back to after they submit the form, once
// the redirect is set in the newsletter's own Subscribing settings. Until
// then this page is reachable but nothing points at it.
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Check your inbox"
  noindex={true}
  description="One more step to finish subscribing to the AI Audio Report price watch: confirm the address from the email we just sent."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Check your inbox</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    We have sent you an email with one link in it. Click it and you are on the list. Nothing
    is sent to an address that has not confirmed.
  </p>

  <h2>If it has not arrived</h2>
  <p>
    Give it a minute, then look in spam and in the Promotions tab. The sender is AI Audio
    Report. Marking it as not spam once is usually enough to keep the rest in your inbox.
  </p>
  <p>
    Still nothing? <a href={withBase('/contact/')}>Tell us</a> and we will sort it out.
  </p>

  <h2>What you have signed up for</h2>
  <p>
    An email when a price on this site changes, when a vendor rewrites a licence term, or when
    a new comparison goes up. Two a month at most, and the address is used for nothing else.
    Every email carries a one-click unsubscribe, and the list is never sold or shared. The
    detail is in the <a href={withBase('/privacy/')}>privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>While you are here</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={withBase('/articles/')}>Every article</a> is grouped by what you are trying to
    decide, and each one carries the date its prices were last read off the vendor's own page.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
